        "ts": "0:16:23",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-06T04:46:18.801Z"
      },
      "body": "Civil Service Commission"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-09-28",
      "text": "Each applicant will give a 3- to 5-minute summary of their statement before answering questions.",
