        "ts": "0:13:59",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-06T04:46:18.801Z"
      },
      "body": "Civil Service Commission"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-09-28",
      "text": "A final email will tell candidates their interview time may be earlier or later depending on public testimony.",
